abstract: "A completed arithmetic topology-search experiment. Verified multiply-accumulate benchmarks and bounded prior-art comparisons show that a stronger control eliminates an evolved candidate's initial finite-set Pareto-frontier advantage. Includes generator, proof tools, selected evidence, and a short archival report. No novelty, signoff, or fabricated-silicon claim."
